Weather data: Data Source: Environment and Climate Change Canada, used under the ECCC Data Servers End-use
Licence (https://eccc-msc.github.io/open-data/licence/readme_en/). Alert text is reproduced as issued.

Place names: Canadian Geographical Names, Natural Resources Canada, used under the Open Government Licence -
Canada (https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada). The place-name database built by this
software, and included in its Docker image, contains information licensed under that licence.

Radar base map: Canada Base Map - Transportation (CBMT), Natural Resources Canada, used under the Open Government
Licence - Canada.

Avalanche data (optional, off by default): avalanche forecasts, mountain weather station data and Mountain
Information Network reports from Avalanche Canada (avalanche.ca) and the agencies that own its forecasts. Avalanche
Canada publishes no open licence; its Terms of Use (https://avalanche.ca/terms-of-use) say its material may not be
reproduced without prior written consent. This tool is not affiliated with or endorsed by Avalanche Canada or any
forecasting agency.

Test fixtures in test/fixtures/ are responses captured from the services above, under the same licences and
terms; the Avalanche Canada field reports among them have the submitters' usernames and user ids removed.
